{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30307","headline":"昔昔盐二十首 惊魂同夜鹊 · 赵嘏","name":"昔昔盐二十首 惊魂同夜鹊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里无人见，衆情难与论。\n思君常入梦，同鹊屡惊魂。\n孤寝红罗帐，双啼玉筯痕。\n妾心甘自保，岂复暂忘恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}